The user tried to use the get_services tool, which relies on Grafana, but that failed because the Jaeger service (jaeger-out.observe.svc.cluster.local) couldn't be resolved. This indicates a broader network or DNS issue within the cluster. The next step should be to check the DNS configuration or ensure that the necessary services are available.

