Given the current error, the most immediate step is to resolve the DNS issue for jaeger-out.observe.svc.cluster.local. This could involve checking the DNS settings in the cluster, ensuring that the service exists, or verifying that the DNS server is functioning correctly. Alternatively, the user could try to ping the service name from within the cluster to see if it resolves.

